  "packageHashAlgorithm": "SHA512",
  "packageSize": 289231,
  "published": "2026-05-11T21:50:59.14Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "See CHANGELOG.md. Second red-team pass: Sphere3D/Bounds3D/Circle3D/OrientedBounds3D `Create` factories now validate preconditions and throw on invalid inputs (consistent with Plane3D.FromHessian's renamed-precondition treatment in 0.4.0). Capsule-solver thresholds centralized in named Thresholds.cs constants with derivation rationale. Subpath2D.GetTessellationAabb cache removed (thread-unsafe in a class without explicit threading docs); now O(N) per call with positive-tolerance validation. Netstandard2.0 smoke test rewritten as a net472 runtime runner. README \"Why this library, not X?\" subsection added. README \"Factory conventions\" table restructured to honestly categorize preconditions vs derivation.",
  "verbatimVersion": "0.5.0",
